      "page": 145
    }
  ],
  "exercise_count": 13,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "需要求解的线性方程组，它的变量的系数常常都不等于零。这就要求将方程组变形，至少使其中一个方程的某个变量的系数等于零，也就是化成上面讨论过的那种类型。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 132,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0138#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们来介绍解二元线性方程组的一种基本方法——加减消元法。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 132,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0138#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设已知方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\qquad(1)\\\\x-y=6.\\qquad(2)\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 132,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0138#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "把已知方程左右两边分别相加，得到一个新方程：$3x+2y=13$。　　(3)",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "作方程（1）和（2）的图象，作出的两条直线相交于点 $A$ $(5,-1)$（图 104）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-104",
      "label": "图 104",
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-105",
      "label": "图 105",
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 104",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 104",
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 105",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 105",
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "直线（3）是不是也经过点 $A(5,-1)$ 呢？为了回答这个问题，我们指出，当 $x=5$，$y=-1$ 时，方程（1）和（2）变成真等式。如果将两个等式左右两边分别相加，那么又得到一个真等式。因此，数对 $x=5$，$y=-1$ 不仅满足方程（1）和（2），也满足方程（3）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "这就是说，直线（3）经过直线（1）和（2）的交点 $A$（图 105）。因为直线（3）不同任一已知直线重合，所以方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\\\x-y=6\\end{cases}$和方程组$\\begin{cases}2x+3y=7,\\\\3x+2y=13\\end{cases}$　　或　　$\\begin{cases}3x+2y=13,\\\\x-y=6\\end{cases}$有完全相同的解：$x=5$，$y=-1$（点 $A$ 的坐标）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 133,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0139#8",
        "p0140#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "上面的例子说明一条重要的性质，这条性质以后我们要用到。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果将线性方程组的两个方程相加而得到的方程代替原方程组中的一个方程，那么新方程组和原方程组有相同的解集合。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "下面我们将说明怎样利用这个性质来解线性方程组。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 1. 解方程组：$\\begin{cases}2x+y=9,\\\\x-y=24.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将已知方程左右两边分别相加，得到一个新的方程，用这个方程代替原方程组的一个方程：$\\begin{cases}3x=33,\\\\x-y=24.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从所得方程组的第一个方程求得：$x=11$。将求得的 $x$值代入第二个方程，得 $y=-13$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：$\\{(11,-13)\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 2. 解方程组：$\\begin{cases}5x+11y=8,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果将这两个方程左右两边分别相加，结果并没有化简，因为一个变量也没有消去。但是，如果事先把第一个方程的各项都乘以 $2$，而第二个方程不变，那么两个方程中 $x$ 的系数是相反数：$\\begin{cases}-10x-22y=-16,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 134,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0140#10",
        "p0141#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "现在将两个方程相加，得到方程 $-29y=58$，其中 $x$ 的系数等于零。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "用方程 $-29y=58$ 代替原方程组的第一个方程，得到新方程组：$\\begin{cases}-29y=58,\\\\10x-7y=74.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从方程 $-29y=58$ 得到：$y=-2$。将 $y=-2$ 代入第二个方程，解得 $x=6$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：$\\{(6,-2)\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例 3. 解方程组：$\\begin{cases}9x+7y=7,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将第一个方程各项乘以 $3$，第二个方程各项乘以 $7$：$\\begin{cases}27x+21y=21,\\\\14x-21y=-595.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "将两个方程相加，得$\\begin{cases}41x=-574,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "由此得：$\\begin{cases}x=-14,\\\\2x-3y=-85.\\end{cases}$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "从后一个方程组求得：$y=19$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "答：$\\{(-14,19)\\}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 135,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0141#11"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
